      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns8AAAABId49HA",
      "title": "Add boar (Base)",
      "author": "sopacrew",
      "number": 1370,
      "body": "Adds the boar token on Base (chain 8453).\n\n- Address: 0x0cbf291Ba052174879d90bf781dF1A5F2BC5Bb07\n- Name, symbol and decimals match on-chain data: boar / boar / 18\n- Native to Base (launched through Clanker v4), not bridged from L1, so the entry uses `nobridge`\n- Logo: data/boar/logo.svg (458x462)\n- Website: https://boarapp.com · X: @boar_app\n- BOAR is a free, offline AI research app for Android; $boar is its community token.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T19:15:09Z",
